{"type":"message","id":"73f38c57","parentId":"ef5fd617","timestamp":"2026-03-02T04:40:03.298Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-38f1c020c0c74ffbb8791915aed871dc","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agents:\n- main (default)\n  Identity: 🌿 行止 (Xíng Zhǐ) (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent\n  Model: bailian/glm-5\n  Routing rules: 0\n  Routing: default (no explicit rules)\n- leader-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/glm-5\n  Routing rules: 0\n- search-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/search-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/search-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/qwen3.5-plus\n  Routing rules: 0\n- design-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/design-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/design-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/qwen3.5-max\n  Routing rules: 0\n- code-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/code-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/code-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/glm-5\n  Routing rules: 0\n- test-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/test-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/test-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/glm-5\n  Routing rules: 0\n- review-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/review-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/review-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/glm-5\n  Routing rules: 0\n- docs-agent\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/agents/docs-agent/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/docs-agent/agent\n  Model: bailian/qwen3.5-plus\n  Routing rules: 0\nRouting rules map channel/account/peer to an agent. Use --bindings for full rules.\nChannel status reflects local config/creds. For live health: openclaw channels status --probe."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1768,"aggregated":"Agents:\n- main (default)\n  Identity: 🌿 行止 (Xíng Zhǐ) (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.