{"type":"message","id":"f2911f9e","parentId":"43a41860","timestamp":"2026-03-02T04:40:52.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要使用正确的命令来调用其他 agent。根据 subagent context 中的说明，我应该使用 `sessions_spawn` 来生成 subagent。让我查看正确的语法。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-1698e436936f498296fcd6803ce2d7f0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw agent --agent search-agent --message \"调研 URL 缩短器 CLI 工具的最佳实践：\n\n## 调研目标\n开发一个 Node.js CLI 工具，需要调研以下方面：\n\n### 1. CLI 框架选择\n对比 commander.js、yargs、oclif 框架的优缺点\n\n### 2. URL 短链接算法\n- hash 算法（MD5/SHA 转短码）\n- 自增 ID 方案\n- 短码生成策略（长度、字符集、冲突处理）\n\n### 3. SQLite 存储方案\n- Node.js SQLite 库选择（better-sqlite3/sqlite3）\n- 数据库 schema 设计\n- 性能考虑\n\n### 4. 输出格式设计\n- JSON 输出\n- 表格格式\n- 彩色输出库选择\n\n## 工作目录\n/home/one/.openclaw/agents/main/workspace/url-shortener\n\n请提供详细的技术选型建议，包括具体的包名和版本推荐。\" --json 2>&1 | head -200","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":62,"output":322,"cacheRead":15610,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15994,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772426443353}}
