{"type":"message","id":"cb210019","parentId":"0d04af5f","timestamp":"2026-03-02T04:49:37.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在让我创建 README.md 和 Jest 配置文件：","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-df45d970a6be4c628fcea4bc47537d34","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /home/one/.openclaw/agents/main/workspace/url-shortener/README.md << 'EOF'\n# URL Shortener CLI\n\nA simple command-line tool for shortening and expanding URLs using Base62 encoding and SQLite storage.\n\n## Features\n\n- ✨ **Shorten URLs** - Generate short codes from long URLs\n- 🔍 **Expand URLs** - Look up original URLs from short codes\n- 📋 **List URLs** - View all shortened URLs in a table\n- 🗑️ **Delete URLs** - Remove shortened URLs\n- 💾 **SQLite Storage** - Persistent storage with no external dependencies\n- 🎨 **Colorful Output** - Easy-to-read terminal output with colors\n- 📊 **JSON Output** - Machine-readable output with `--json` flag\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Clone and install\ncd url-shortener\nnpm install\n\n# Link for global usage\nnpm link\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### Shorten a URL\n\n```bash\n# Basic usage\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com/very-long-url\n\n# With custom short code\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com -c mycode\n\n# With title\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com -t \"Example Site\"\n\n# Force new code (even if URL exists)\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com -f\n\n# JSON output\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com --json\n```\n\n### Expand a Short Code\n\n```bash\n# Expand to original URL\nurl-shortener expand abc123\n\n# JSON output\nurl-shortener expand abc123 --json\n```\n\n### List All URLs\n\n```bash\n# List all\nurl-shortener list\n\n# Limit results\nurl-shortener list --limit 10\n\n# JSON output\nurl-shortener list --json\n```\n\n### Delete a URL\n\n```bash\nurl-shortener delete abc123\n```\n\n## Short Code Generation\n\nUses **Base62 encoding** (0-9, a-z, A-Z) with auto-incrementing IDs:\n\n| Length | Capacity |\n|--------|----------|\n| 4 chars | ~14.7M URLs |\n| 5 chars | ~916M URLs |\n| 6 chars | ~56.8B URLs |\n\nExample: ID `12345` → short code `d7C`\n\n## Database\n\nData is stored in `~/.url-shortener/urls.db` by default.\n\n### Custom Database Path\n\n```bash\nurl-shortener shorten https://example.com -d /path/to/custom.db\n```\n\n### Schema\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE urls (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  short_code TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  original_url TEXT NOT NULL,\n  title TEXT,\n  created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  expires_at DATETIME,\n  click_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0\n);\n```\n\n## Development\n\n### Run Tests\n\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nurl-shortener/\n├── bin/\n│   └── cli.js           # CLI entry point\n├── src/\n│   ├── db.js            # Database operations\n│   ├── encoder.js       # Base62 encoder/decoder\n│   └── commands/\n│       ├── shorten.js   # Shorten command\n│       ├── expand.js    # Expand command\n│       └── list.js      # List command\n├── tests/\n│   ├── encoder.test.js\n│   ├── db.test.js\n│   └── commands.test.js\n├── package.json\n└── README.md\n```\n\n## API Usage\n\n```javascript\nimport { shorten } from './src/commands/shorten.js';\nimport { expand } from './src/commands/expand.js';\nimport { list } from './src/commands/list.js';\n\n// Shorten a URL\nconst result = shorten('https://example.com');\nconsole.log(result.shortCode); // e.g., \"abc12\"\n\n// Expand a short code\nconst url = expand('abc12');\nconsole.log(url.originalUrl); // \"https://example.com\"\n\n// List all\nconst all = list();\nconsole.log(all.urls);\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- **commander** - CLI framework\n- **better-sqlite3** - SQLite database\n- **chalk** - Terminal colors\n- **cli-table3** - Table formatting\n\n## License\n\nMIT\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1028,"output":948,"cacheRead":28363,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30339,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772426955979}}
